sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant CLI as CLI Tool / Smart TV
    participant KC as Keycloak (Auth Server)
    participant Phone as User's Phone / Laptop
    
    CLI->>KC: POST /auth/device (client_id)
    KC->>CLI: Returns `user_code`, `verification_uri`, `device_code`
    CLI->>User: Display: "Go to URL & enter code"
    
    User->>Phone: Navigates to verification_uri & enters code
    Phone->>KC: Authenticates & grants access
    
    loop Polling (every X seconds)
        CLI->>KC: POST /token (grant_type=device_code & device_code=...)
        KC->>CLI: Returns pending or Access + Refresh Tokens
    end
    
    CLI->>User: Authentication complete!
